msgid "SET_POSITION_TARGET_LOCAL_NED"
msgstr "SET_POSITION_TARGET_LOCAL_NED"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:52
#: 5633c8fd4c4d472a81e63fc269b41384
msgid ""
"Set the vehicle's target position (as an offset in NED from the EKF "
"origin), velocity, acceleration, heading or turn rate.  The message "
"definition can be found `here "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_POSITION_TARGET_LOCAL_NED>`__"
msgstr ""
"设置飞行器的目标位置（以 NED 坐标系相对 EKF 原点的偏移量表示）、速度、加速度、航向或转向速率。消息定义可在 `此处 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_POSITION_TARGET_LOCAL_NED>`__"
" 找到"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:84
#: ../../source/docs/copter-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:306
#: 7b12ab578f70411cb932a674978d439a b0fa15f127c8446bb1ed6246fc5357e8
msgid ""
"Bitmask to indicate which fields should be **ignored** by the vehicle "
"(see POSITION_TARGET_TYPEMASK enum)"
msgstr "位掩码，用于指示飞行器应 **忽略** 哪些字段（见 POSITION_TARGET_TYPEMASK 枚举）"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:86
#: ../../source/docs/copter-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:308
#: 528e55382bbd4665805ce31e0520c000 8192d7305178457c94425f26f7eb65dd
msgid ""
"bit1:PosX, bit2:PosY, bit3:PosZ, bit4:VelX, bit5:VelY, bit6:VelZ, "
"bit7:AccX, bit8:AccY, bit9:AccZ, bit11:yaw, bit12:yaw rate"
msgstr ""
"bit1:PosX, bit2:PosY, bit3:PosZ, bit4:VelX, bit5:VelY, bit6:VelZ, "
"bit7:AccX, bit8:AccY, bit9:AccZ, bit11:yaw, bit12:yaw rate"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:88
