#: 28003e13b14b495abed37b5f95b49958 d9d6e67bf01141ae8ed9d6646c1d1c63
msgid ""
"When providing Pos, Vel and/or Accel all 3 axis must be provided.  At "
"least one of Pos, Vel and Accel must be provided (e.g. providing Yaw or "
"YawRate alone is not supported)"
msgstr ""
"提供 Pos、Vel 和/或 Accel 时，必须提供所有 3 个轴。Pos、Vel 和 Accel 中至少要提供一个（例如，仅提供 Yaw 或 "
"YawRate 不受支持）"

