#: 40c3d823659b4a58b9ef6da0063612c5 d2c55cc6deaa4a1aa36015a1b02087c7
msgid ""
"If sending velocity or acceleration commands, they should be re-sent "
"every second (the vehicle will stop after 3 seconds if no command is "
